Qwen-14B & PW-600 & 600 & 75.2 & 75.5 & +0.3 & 0.800 & -- \\
Qwen3-14B & PW-600 & 600 & 77.5 & 77.3 & $-$0.2 & 0.850 & -- \\
Qwen-72B & D012$^\dagger$ & 60 & 86.7 & 86.7 & 0.0 & 1.000 & 10.0 \\
